{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23446","headline":"醉封诗筒寄微之 · 白居易","name":"醉封诗筒寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一生休戚与穷通，处处相随事事同。\n未死又怜沧海郡，无儿俱作白头翁。\n展眉只仰三桮後，代面唯凭五字中。\n爲向两州邮吏道，莫辞来去递诗筒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}